                <pb facs="0243" n="163" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg163"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mc Wade to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Canton</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic">March 1,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Rebellion Kuangsi; cause, disbanded soldiers. My request viceroy detail
                    additional troops; notified governor hold responsible safety missionaries,
                    converts property. Watching developments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McWade</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
